#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to find answers to questions or problems you encounter while using IBM "
"Quantum Platform or Qiskit Runtime"
msgstr ""
"Cómo encontrar respuestas a preguntas o problemas que encuentres al usar IBM"
" Quantum Platform o Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Soporte"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support {#support}"
msgstr "Soporte {#support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get help with IBM Quantum Platform and Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-and-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Obtén ayuda con IBM Quantum Platform y Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-and-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, "
"special programs, and Open Plan (excludes Trial accounts):**\n"
msgstr ""
"**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, "
"programas especiales y Open Plan (excluye cuentas de prueba):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your "
"account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) or a "
"Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Ensure you have "
"selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account"
" or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgstr ""
"Todas las solicitudes de soporte deben enviarse a través del [IBM Cloud&reg;"
" Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Según tu "
"tipo de cuenta, puedes abrir un Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) o un "
"Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Asegúrate de haber"
" seleccionado la cuenta de IBM Cloud adecuada (tu cuenta institucional en la"
" nube o cualquier cuenta que no sea de prueba) en el selector de cuentas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To see all your open IBM Cloud cases or to open a new case, visit the [IBM "
"Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para ver todos tus casos abiertos en IBM Cloud o abrir un nuevo caso, visita"
" el [IBM Cloud Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Please reach out for any technical matter, including platform issues, job "
"errors, Qiskit guidance, or broader quantum computing questions. Our team "
"includes technical experts ready to assist across this full range of "
"topics.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contáctanos para cualquier asunto técnico, incluidos problemas de la "
"plataforma, errores en los jobs, orientación sobre Qiskit o preguntas más "
"amplias sobre computación cuántica. Nuestro equipo incluye expertos técnicos"
" listos para ayudarte en toda esta gama de temas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Community support:**\n"
msgstr "**Soporte comunitario:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Have a Trial account or looking for other support options?  [Join the Qiskit"
" Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) to get help from our large "
"community of users and experts. In Slack you will find topical channels such"
" as #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-"
"ecosystem, and many more.\n"
msgstr ""
"¿Tienes una cuenta de prueba o buscas otras opciones de soporte? [Únete a la"
" comunidad de Qiskit en Slack](https://qisk.it/join-slack) para obtener "
"ayuda de nuestra amplia comunidad de usuarios y expertos. En Slack "
"encontrarás canales temáticos como #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, "
"#qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, y muchos más.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also use [Stack "
"Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) for "
"support from the wider community about quantum computing and programming-"
"related questions.\n"
msgstr ""
"También puedes usar [Stack "
"Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) para "
"obtener soporte de la comunidad más amplia sobre preguntas relacionadas con "
"la computación cuántica y la programación.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Having trouble creating an account or logging in? {#having-trouble-creating-"
"an-account-or-logging-in}"
msgstr ""
"¿Tienes problemas para crear una cuenta o iniciar sesión? {#having-trouble-"
"creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If you get an error when you create an IBM Cloud&reg; account,** first "
"check whether you have access to the [Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) on IBM Cloud.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Si recibes un error al crear una cuenta de IBM Cloud&reg;,** primero "
"verifica si tienes acceso al [Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) en IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have access to the \"Create Case\" page, choose Account (Managing "
"your account and resources) as the category, followed by Account "
"verification as the Subtopic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si tienes acceso a la página \"Create Case\", elige Account (Managing your "
"account and resources) como categoría y luego Account verification como "
"Subtopic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not have access, open a case on the [Create an Account, Login or "
"Billing Request](https://watson.service-"
"now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si no tienes acceso, abre un caso en la página [Create an Account, Login or "
"Billing Request](https://watson.service-"
"now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are getting an error while trying to create an account and **your "
"country is on the [Personal use "
"availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-"
"getting-started#signup-personalaccts) list,** explore the following "
"options:\n"
msgstr ""
"Si recibes un error al intentar crear una cuenta y **tu país aparece en la "
"lista de [disponibilidad para uso "
"personal](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-getting-"
"started#signup-personalaccts),** explora las siguientes opciones:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [Documentation](/docs) and [Learning](/learning) resources "
"without an account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puedes usar los recursos de [Documentación](/docs) y "
"[Aprendizaje](/learning) sin una cuenta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are a student or educator at a degree-granting accredited academic "
"institution, you can create a [SkillsBuild Technology Access "
"account](https://github.com/academic-"
"initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-"
"register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (see the [SkillsBuild "
"Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) for more "
"information).\n"
msgstr ""
"Si eres estudiante o docente en una institución académica acreditada que "
"otorga títulos, puedes crear una [cuenta de SkillsBuild Technology "
"Access](https://github.com/academic-"
"initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-"
"register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (consulta las "
"[preguntas frecuentes sobre SkillsBuild Technology "
"Access](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) para más información).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) for 30 "
"days of free access (Note that you will likely lose access at the end of the"
" trial).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea una cuenta de prueba](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) y "
"obtén 30 días de acceso gratuito (ten en cuenta que probablemente perderás "
"el acceso al final del período de prueba).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If you see the message \"This account is inactive\",** visit the [IBM "
"Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify if you have any pending actions to "
"complete in your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Si ves el mensaje \"This account is inactive\",** visita la [documentación"
" de IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) para saber por qué y cómo solucionarlo, o accede a [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) para verificar si tienes acciones pendientes "
"que completar en tu cuenta.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"If you are the **owner** of a Pay-As-You-Go or Subscription account, you need to create an IBM Cloud account and provide billing information for verification.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Nota\">\n"
"Si eres el **propietario** de una cuenta Pay-As-You-Go o de Suscripción, necesitas crear una cuenta de IBM Cloud y proporcionar información de facturación para la verificación.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are **invited to join** an account, simply accept the email "
"invitation and follow the [provided steps](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) to "
"gain access without providing billing information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si has sido **invitado a unirte** a una cuenta, simplemente acepta la "
"invitación por correo electrónico y sigue los [pasos "
"indicados](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) para obtener acceso sin proporcionar"
" información de facturación.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trial account owners** can create an Open Plan instance for 30 days "
"without providing billing information. At the end of the trial, users must "
"provide billing information to verify and continue using their account. User"
" will *not be charged* if they continue using the free Open Plan, but can "
"choose to upgrade to other paid plans at that time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los **propietarios de cuentas de prueba** pueden crear una instancia de Open"
" Plan durante 30 días sin proporcionar información de facturación. Al "
"finalizar el período de prueba, los usuarios deben proporcionar información "
"de facturación para verificar y continuar usando su cuenta. No se les "
"cobrará si siguen usando el Open Plan gratuito, aunque pueden optar por "
"cambiar a otros planes de pago en ese momento.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information about IBM Cloud accounts, visit the [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Para más información sobre las cuentas de IBM Cloud, visita la página de [preguntas frecuentes sobre cuentas de IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source support {#open-source-support}"
msgstr "Soporte de código abierto {#open-source-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code "
"to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-"
"conduct), PDF license agreements for "
"[individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and "
"[corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-"
"cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-"
"strategy), and the "
"[contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) "
"and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) "
"guides.\n"
msgstr ""
"Consulta los [recursos de código abierto](/guides/) para obtener detalles "
"sobre cómo contribuir con código a Qiskit. Allí encontrarás información "
"sobre el [código de conducta](/guides/code-of-conduct), acuerdos de licencia"
" en PDF para contribuidores "
"[individuales](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) y "
"[corporativos](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-"
"cla.pdf), la [estrategia de versiones](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-strategy),"
" y las guías para "
"[contribuidores](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)"
" y "
"[mantenedores](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md).\n"

